    "text": "Skip to ArticleUnlimited Digital Access -Start Today for $1 - Sale Ends 5/3/26CloseCostco, Lowe’s will close all U.S. locations for 24 hours this weekendUpdated: Mar. 31, 2026, 10:13 a.m.|Published: Mar. 31, 2026, 10:12 a.m.Costco will be closed on Sunday due to Easter.Owen ReiterBy Annalise Knudson | aknudson@siadvance.comIf you need to pick up anything from Costco or Lowe’s, plan on shopping before Sunday. The retailers will be closed for 24 hours on Sunday, April 5, in observance of a holiday.Lowe’s and Costco will both be closed on Sunday due to Easter — one of the major holidays observed by the stores, according to their websites. The Costco store in New Springville will be open this week, including Good Friday, from 10 a.m. to 8:30 p.m., and Saturday from 9:30 a.m. to 7 p.m. Lowe’s locations on Staten Island will be open the rest of the week from 6 a.m. to 10 p.m. RECOMMENDEDWant another Costco in your area? Here’s how to suggest a new locationApr. 11, 2026, 3:59 p.m.Costco faces class action lawsuit over this California lawApr. 12, 2026, 11:30 a.m.Costco is closed for several holidays throughout the year, including New Year’s Day, Memorial Day, Independence Day, Labor Day, Thanksgiving, and Christmas.Lowe’s is typically closed for Easter, Thanksgiving, and Christmas, though hours on other holidays may be reduced.The retailers’ websites, Costco.com and lowes.com are always open for business.You Might Like5+ Billion Threats Stopped. Trusted By Cybersecurity ExpertsMalwarebytesUndoActor convicted of sexual assault found dead in prison cellsilive.comUndoMeet Divorced Women In ST LOUISInstantalksUndoCommunity mourns N.J. nurse killed by estranged husband at worksilive.comUndoMore Spam Calls? Your Personal Data May Have LeakedMalwarebytesLearn MoreUndoPopular actress, 41, pregnant with first child one year after husband died by suicidesilive.comUndoby Taboolaby TaboolaSponsored LinksSponsored LinksPromoted LinksPromoted Links Ad Unmute",
